  data: {
    LLM: "Bidding is less about hand-strength accuracy than in Contract Bridge. The goal is primarily to reach the 30-point threshold for a game as cheaply as possible.\n\nOvertrick Strategy: Since overtricks count toward the game, you can bid conservatively. A bid of '1 No Trump' potentially scores the whole game (30 pts) if you take 9 tricks.\n\nDefensive Doubling: Double an opponent if you are certain they cannot make their bid, but be waryâ€”if they make it, the doubled tricks may win them the game immediately.",
